OL,3,GNEWSAWoman suffered 78 injuries in
OL,4,Aattack by partner, murder trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman suffered 78 injuries to her
OL,7,Fhead and body after a "brutal" attack
OL,8,Fby her partner, a murder trial has been
OL,9,Ftold.
OL,11,FAlexander Brennan, 54, denies murdering
OL,12,FBrodie MacGregor, 23, in her flat in
OL,13,FGlasgow's Springburn on 26 August 2024.
OL,15,FForensic pathologist, Dr Julie McAdam,
OL,16,Ftold the High Court in Glasgow that the
OL,17,Fcause of death was "extensive facial
OL,18,Finjures".
